# Tiền Đây — Git Rules

## Single repository
- Tiền Đây has exactly ONE Git repository.
- Always work in the existing Tiền Đây repository.
- Never create a second repository for a phase, feature, prototype, platform, or experiment.
- Never create a duplicate codebase as a workaround.

## Versioning
- Do not create v4/v5 as separate projects or repositories.
- Use Git history, branches, tags, or commits to represent milestones when appropriate.

## Before changes
- Inspect git status before significant work.
- Do not overwrite unrelated user changes.
- If the working tree contains unexpected changes, stop and report them before destructive actions.

## After changes
- Review the diff.
- Remove generated junk and temporary files that do not belong in the repository.
- Run relevant tests/build checks before declaring the task complete.

## Safety
- Never force-push, reset, delete branches, or discard user changes unless explicitly instructed.
- Never change remote configuration unless explicitly instructed.
